  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nInput control elements (`button`, `input`, `select` etc.) expose a `.form` property that returns their [form owner](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#form-owner).\n\nHowever, the result of this property differs across browsers when the form-associated element is inside a `ShadowRoot`:\n\n- **Blink, Gecko:** `.form` returns `null`.\n- **WebKit:** `.form` returns the associated `HTMLFormElement`.\n\nSpec: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#association-of-controls-and-forms\n\n```html\n  <form>\n      <div>\n        <template shadowrootmode=\"open\">\n          <select>\n            <option>Rabbit</option>\n          </select>\n          <input />\n        </template>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n```",
